# This branch is records-only and uniform CRLF. Both attributes matter:
#   -text                  freeze the bytes; never normalise EOL on checkout or
#                          commit, so an imported record stays byte-identical.
#   whitespace=-trailing-space
#                          the CR of every CRLF line otherwise reads as trailing
#                          whitespace and buries `git diff --check` in noise.
# Neither changes a stored blob. Converting this branch to LF instead would
# rewrite every file whole, which is exactly the unreviewable diff the v5.1
# bootstrap was replaced for.
* -text whitespace=-trailing-space
